# User-owned loose media retained locally but not approved as repository assets.
/1061ef42-3385-4527-a2cf-b2ed0c5d8579.png
/Firefly.jpg
/logo.png

# Common local/editor artifacts outside the generated application.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
/docs/CARLOS CARPIO RESUME.pdf
*.log

# Local dependency cache at the repository root.
/.pnpm-store/

# Per-machine agent settings. Shared agent config stays tracked.
**/.claude/settings.local.json

# Local arcade candidate clones and build scratch (C.1). Never commit.
/_arcade-build/

# Design handoffs: keep the design work, exclude the snapshot of this repository
# that the design tool ingested as context. Committing a stale copy of the repo
# into the repo is permanent in history and slows every clone.
**/*-handoff/**/uploads/
# The delivered archives themselves; the unpacked design files are what we keep.
**/*-handoff.zip
